    "notes": "We built this dataset is on 2.262 student goals in natural language, collected at the Universities of Bremen, Hannover, and Osnabr\u00fcck in 2019. Six independent raters assigned tags from a set of 28 to those goals. The dataset includes the complete data processing pipeline, from raw data to results and figures generated by a data analysis script written in Python. The README.md file describes folders, files, and processing.",
